Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
Platforms/*/Binaries/
Platforms/*/Build/
Platforms/*/Intermediate/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated project / IDE files
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*.sln
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.opendb
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/
.vs/
.vsconfig
.idea/
.vscode/
*.code-workspace
UpgradeLog*.htm
Backup/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Baked lighting / build data (regenerate with Build Lighting)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
*_BuiltData.uasset

# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Recorded experiment output.
# Runs are written to Saved/SimulatorRuns/ and are distributed
# separately as an archival dataset -- never commit them here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
SimulatorRuns/
*.csv
*.log

